D04 implements a deterministic, content-addressed BootCognitionReport Photon over D01/D02/D03 evidence.

The report remains derived evidence, never a source of boot truth. The recorder reads through BootSnapshotLoader, scans integrity, rehydrates context, analyzes deltas, publishes idempotently, and preserves cancellation semantics.

Productive activation is intentionally constrained to the recorder boundary so boot/report failures cannot silently become authoritative runtime state changes.
